OL,3,GNEWSADriver in his 30s dies after car
OL,4,Acrashes into tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver in his 30s has died after a
OL,7,Fcar crashed into a tree, police say.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,10,Fcrash on Bakers Hill, between Mickleton
OL,11,Fand Hidcote in Gloucestershire, at
OL,12,Faround 07:30 BST.
OL,14,FGloucestershire Constabulary said a
OL,15,FFord C-Max had left the road and
OL,16,Fcollided with a tree. A 36-year-old man
OL,17,Ffrom the Stratford-upon-Avon area was
OL,18,Fdeclared dead at the scene and his next
OL,19,Fof kin have been informed, police said.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
