OL,3,GNEWSADriver in his 30s dies after car
OL,4,Acrashes into tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force added road closures remained
OL,7,Fin place on Bakers Hill while crash
OL,8,Finvestigators examined the scene.
OL,9,FOfficers urged anyone who might have
OL,10,Fwitnessed the crash to contact police.
